      "publishedAt": null,
      "onlineStoreUrl": null,
      "descriptionHtml": "<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Fabric &amp; feel:</strong> Smooth stretch swim fabric with a skirted one-piece silhouette for an easy poolside fit.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Family story:</strong> A coordinated mom-and-daughter swimsuit moment made for beach days, pool mornings, and vacation photos.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Print:</strong> Blue daisy florals on a soft blue ground keep the matching look bright, sweet, and photo-ready.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Design details:</strong> Halter-style neckline, skirt overlay, and coordinated daisy print shown for both mother and daughter styles.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Care:</strong> Rinse after swimming, hand wash cold, line dry in the shade, and avoid bleach or rough poolside surfaces.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Size range:</strong> Girls Child 2 Years to Child 9-10 Years; Mother M to Mother 3XL.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Size Chart - Swim Dress</h3>\n<table id=\"size-chart\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Size</th>\n      <th>Age</th>\n      <th>Weight (kg/lbs)</th>\n      <th>Height (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Chest/Bust (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Skirt Length (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Pant/Short or - (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Hip (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Waist (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Garment Length (cm/in)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 2 Years</td>\n<td>2-3</td>\n<td>7.5-12.5 kg / 16.5-27.6 lbs</td>\n<td>80-100 cm / 31.5-39.4 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 4 Years</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>12.5-17.5 kg / 27.6-38.6 lbs</td>\n<td>100-110 cm / 39.4-43.3 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 5 Years</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>17.5-22.5 kg / 38.6-49.6 lbs</td>\n<td>110-120 cm / 43.3-47.2 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 6-7 Years</td>\n<td>6-7</td>\n<td>22.5-27.5 kg / 49.6-60.6 lbs</td>\n<td>120-130 cm / 47.2-51.2 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 8 Years</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>27.5-37.5 kg / 60.6-82.7 lbs</td>\n<td>130-140 cm / 51.2-55.1 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 9-10 Years</td>\n<td>9-10</td>\n<td>37.5-50 kg / 82.7-110.2 lbs</td>\n<td>140-150 cm / 55.1-59.1 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother M</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>up to 45 kg / up to 99.2 lbs</td>\n<td>150-165 cm / 59.1-65.0 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>up to 66.7 cm / up to 26.2 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother L</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>45-52.5 kg / 99.2-115.7 lbs</td>\n<td>155-165 cm / 61.0-65.0 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>66.7-73.3 cm / 26.2-28.9 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother XL</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>52.5-60 kg / 115.7-132.3 lbs</td>\n<td>160-170 cm / 63.0-66.9 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>73.3-80.0 cm / 28.9-31.5 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother 2XL</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>60-67.5 kg / 132.3-148.8 lbs</td>\n<td>160-175 cm / 63.0-68.9 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>80.0-86.7 cm / 31.5-34.1 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother 3XL</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>67.5-75 kg / 148.8-165.3 lbs</td>\n<td>165-175 cm / 65.0-68.9 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>86.7-90.0 cm / 34.1-35.4 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>The Blue Daisy Mommy and Me Swimsuits bring a soft floral swim-dress look to mother-daughter matching. The daisy print feels cheerful for sunny photos, while the skirted one-piece shape keeps the set easy for pool days, resort mornings, and beach vacations.</p>\n\n<p>The girls' and moms' suits coordinate through the same blue floral print and skirted silhouette. Use the chart-backed height and weight guidance for each swimmer, and keep unsupported garment measurements as a dash rather than guessing beyond the vendor evidence.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Blue daisy print:</strong> A fresh floral pattern that reads sweet, bright, and easy to match in family photos.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Skirted one-piece shape:</strong> The swim-dress overlay gives the set a polished beachwear look.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Mother-daughter sizing:</strong> Child rows come from the visible selector guidance and mother rows come from the attached adult chart.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Vacation-ready match:</strong> Made for pool days, beach trips, resort photos, and coordinated summer memories.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose the sizes you need and pack a matching daisy swim look for beach days, poolside photos, and sunny family memories.</p>",
